;; #514 L3 METTA ENCODING (2026-10-22) RazorAttention × RLCT. TYPE DECLS: (: head Concept) (: parameter Concept) (: token Concept) (: functional Concept) (: subposterior Concept) (: rlct Concept) (: stratum Concept) (: budget Concept) (: step Concept) (: score Concept). D1: parameter w in Theta subset R^d; per-layer attention A_l,h softmax over cache tokens j=1..L_l; layer budget B_l = floor(b_l L_l). D2: (-> functional head token) Razi weight r_j = sum over retrieval heads H_ret of entropy-weighted attention mass w_h a_l,h,j, w_h softmax over negative head attention entropy; finite composition of analytic maps (exp inner products, affine projections, rational sum-to-one). D3: (-> subposterior functional) pruning map P_b keeps top-B_l tokens by r_j, ties by fixed order; pruned-fiber family Theta_{b_l} indexes posterior restriction; P_b piecewise-analytic in (w, b). D4: (-> rlct subposterior) lambda_pruned(b) = local RLCT of pruned-restricted posterior; finite by resolution of singularities. D5: (-> score budget) effective RLCT lambda_eff(b) = b-weighted stratum blend over Theta_pruned and Theta_evicted; Theta = disjoint union of locally analytic strata. D6: (-> stratum budget) budget fraction b_l as layer-wise stratum selector, analogous to #513 sink magnitude s; hypothesis lambda_eff monotone in b. D7: (-> step score) critical budget b* such that for b < b* downstream quality collapses; eviction of high-Razi tokens = stratum crossing in sense of #229/#513. C1 PROVEN stv 1.0 0.95: (Implication (Inheritance RaziFunctional R_an-definable) (Inheritance (fiber-over w) FiniteRLCT)) — finite composition of piecewise-analytic maps; R_an closed under composition; resolution of singularities; same definability class as #303/#508/#512/#513 C1. C2 CONJECTURAL stv 0.6 0.8: (Implication (Inheritance Theta_pruned low-rlct-stratum) (less lambda_pruned(b) lambda_full)) — gap: ordering unproven. C3 CONJECTURAL stv 0.5 0.75: (Implication (Inheritance b_l stratum-selector) (monotone-decrease lambda_eff b)) — gap: no per-head estimator (P1 deferred). C4 CONJECTURAL stv 0.5 0.7: (Implication (less b b-star) quality-collapse) — gap: b* unquantified, layer-coupling open. C5 CONJECTURAL stv 0.5 0.7: (Inheritance pruning-rank-singularity generic-codim0) — gap: transversality unproven; sink-head interplay open (#513 P2: no Razi signal on sinks). CAVEATS: (1) C2-C5 rest on posterior concentration assumption; (2) head-restricted RLCT estimator unestablished; (3) b* and layer coupling unquantified; (4) top-k tie-order sensitivity may break piecewise-analyticity at measure-zero locus; (5) falsified if lambda ordering fails on real nets per P6. OPEN PROBLEMS: P1 head-wise SGLD estimator; P2 sink vs retrieval budget allocation; P3 tie-order sensitivity of top-k; P4 b* vs positional encoding; P5 training-time vs inference-time pruning; P6 falsification condition. CROSS-REFS: #229 #502 #508 #512 #513 #336 #8 #16 #100. NEXT: L4 summary + L5 catalog append.